# The switch: a skill the player turns on and off. While it is on, the Bishop's
# four Benevolence skills become their Vengeance forms (see the vengeance folder
# and Skill.toggle).
#
# What it grants doesn't depend on the switch: GMS marks it "[Passive Effects]",
# which is permanent once learned. The switch trades the party's fountains and
# the Bishop's own Heal for four attacks, which is choice enough.
#
# Its half-second cooldown is the gap between two presses and doesn't matter in
# a fight.
name: "Righteously Indignant"
description:
  "Fuel your body with the fury of an avenging angel. Converts Benevolence "
  "skills to Vengeance skills."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP skill_order: 1 }
hyper: true
required_level: 140
max_level: 1
toggle: true
base {
  magic_attack: 50
  final_dmg_pct: 0.30
  ied_pct: 0.20
  ier_pct: 0.10
}
